  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Zambia II Compact - Access to Financial Service Project - Project Preparation Facility (PPF) Activity: The Zambia Project Preparation Facility for EILP (ZAMPPF Activity) aims to increase the number of EILP infrastructure projects that support agriculture value chains to reach financial close by providing:
1. Technical assistance to project developers (e.g., GRZ and private developers) to develop bankable EILP infrastructure projects;
2. Technical assistance and capacity building for public and private project developers.</narrative>
  </description>
